<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Watership Stewards | Veterans Resurgence Project</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }
    .hero-header {
      position: relative;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 7rem 1rem 5rem 1rem;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('Screenshot_20260421-000340.png');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      color: white;
    }
    .hero-content {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero-header h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    .hero-header h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    .hero-header p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #f1f1f1;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    
    /* Separate container below hero image */
    .cards-section {
      background: #111827;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .cards-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 160px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .card-body {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .card-body h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .card-body p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Sub-navigation link bar below cards */
    .sub-nav-bar {
      background: #0b0f19;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .sub-nav-links {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .sub-nav-links a {
      background: #1e293b;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .sub-nav-links a:hover {
      background: #334155;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Hero Header Section -->
  <header class="hero-header">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Watership Stewards</h1>
      <h2>Veterans Resurgence Project</h2>
      <p>A structured, W-2 workforce restoring regional watersheds and reducing hazardous fuels, while building career-track skills in ecology, native plant propagation, and forestry. Integrating FAA Part 107 GIS monitoring and science-based education.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Four Feature Cards in Separate Section Below Image -->
  <section class="cards-section">
    <div class="cards-container">
      
      <div class="card">
        <img src="forest-restoration.jpg" alt="Field Restoration">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div>
            <h3>Forest &amp; Watershed Restoration</h3>
            <p>Structured veteran crews conduct intensive, labor-intensive hazardous fuels reduction, manual slash piling, hand-line construction, and post-wildfire reforestation to enhance regional ecosystem health.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="nursery-propagation.jpg" alt="Community Propagation">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div>
            <h3>Native Plant Nursery &amp; Propagation</h3>
            <p>Scaling up capacity for regional riparian and habitat recovery projects. We cultivate a wide variety of native Willamette Valley species for restoration efforts and community distribution.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="drone-mapping.jpg" alt="Academic Research & Aerial Mapping">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div>
            <h3>Academic Research<br>Aerial Mapping</h3>
            <p>Comprehensive training track for FAA Part 107 Remote Pilot licensing, utilizing aerial thermal imaging for terrain assessment, post-fire watershed analysis, and vegetation health monitoring.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="framework-training.jpg" alt="Operational Framework & Training">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div>
            <h3>Operational Framework &amp; Training</h3>
            <p>A fully integrated, W-2 workforce model combining structured field operations with formal, verifiable educational pathways in soil science, botany, and pest management.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Button Bar for Links to Other Files -->
  <div class="sub-nav-bar">
    <div class="sub-nav-links">
      <a href="framework.html">Operational Framework</a>
      <a href="community.html">Community &amp; Support</a>
      <a href="training-details.html">Training Details</a>
      <a href="gallery.html">Field Gallery</a>
      <a href="executive-vault.html">Executive Vault</a>
      <a href="agreements.html">Agreements &amp; MOUs</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
